      "writtenOn": "2020-10-15T20:03:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We want to switch to FIFO only when needed and not for all the tasks. If the current task policy is (policy \u003d\u003d SCHED_FIFO || policy \u003d\u003d SCHED_RR), we don\u0027t want to switch.",
